 **Parameters:**
-*   **Feature Vector Dimension:** 8 [S1].
-*   **Grid Resolution:** $8 \times 173 \times 173$ (with decoder) vs $1 \times 333 \times 333$ (without decoder) [S1]. Note: Both configurations use the same total number of variables [S1].
